14225.187900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LYt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd3cb58b-c3a0-45d3-a380-dfc12c3c92a7","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"通常のマクロで \u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt; 押して再生止まりましたっけ？","ts":"1630314205.187300","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1630314230.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TQbP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6c19df0-f309-46c0-a348-ef3a96966ac4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"一応ノーマルモードで Esc 押せばベルは鳴るんですよね","ts":"1630314171.186600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h8g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1b2c588-f13c-4204-9d8a-1d15caeb3119","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"かなり前の記憶なので、ちょっと自信がないです。ただ、Esc のような方法で止まってくれればそれがきれいだと思います。","ts":"1630314111.186300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BU3x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1d20ec0-5346-48fa-8d79-27cc3713bfe4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Esc ダメか。直感的には動きそうだけど。試してはないのでなんもわからんな…","ts":"1630313906.184800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5EaZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a532d6c-c873-4978-a199-d55e9f814021","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"`getchar()` で捨てるのはちょっと怖いですが、いいかもしれません。5年前はマクロ実行中かどうかを判定できなかったので、これは当時できなかったのです。いまなら `reg_executing()` で分岐できそう。","ts":"1630312250.184000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U8R597E9H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Og7M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3713e3dd-9224-4496-9f85-e715d18e541a","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"いろいろありがとうございます。昔試した感じだと \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; マッピングでノーマルモードに `\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;` を返してもダメだった覚えがあります。","ts":"1630312160.182800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i=Vyq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd70b387-5f2d-4303-89d9-8647c5711682","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"オペレータを適切に抽象化してドットリピート API をプラグインレベルで作れないかな〜とちょっと考えてます","ts":"1630305443.180300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a0QvN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d135122f-d7d2-4749-90d8-6929ec87b568","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"意図通りかはわからんけど `\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;` は試してみたい","ts":"1630301864.179000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LpSo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"985392c8-2acd-4b13-a1d7-682ce26e72db","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"自分もこういうキー入力が最初にドバっと行われて、それを途中で止めたい。という場合は getchar で吸い上げて捨てるしか思いつきませんねｗ","ts":"1630300561.178600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P=2Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4eaf877-2c9c-4b6f-b7d7-3b50634a0255","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"仙人ですら解決できない問題なので正直厳しい…。","ts":"1630300394.178000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JUiGn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc7a5de8-235e-4157-bbcd-44dd4a9667ac","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"でも、ユーザ定義モーションでマクロを「停止」したいんですね。そのまましっかり動いてくれればいいものかと思っていましたが","ts":"1630300388.177800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=IO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69f9301e-9b5b-4369-a1e7-c9aa25f9b262","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"マクロの実装読んでたけど先行入力積んでるようにしか見えないんですよね","ts":"1630300312.176300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sB7km"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81e5bbfb-5df7-41ab-a5fa-94c44caea9a7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"```function! Motion()\n  while getchar(0)\n  endwhile\nendfunction\n\nnnoremap W :call Motion()\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\nlet @a = 'Wi'```\nこれで`i`に到達しないようにすることはできるけどこれじゃだめなのかな","ts":"1630300214.175800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yk9wM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97a5fb26-69fa-4574-a131-4da1c5e0d128","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"*わざと*マクロをエラーにさせる処理を組み込ませるぐらいなら思いつくのですが。","ts":"1630300142.175100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X4v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7f686c3-dd59-49a2-a25b-adeb20036c57","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"要するに割り込み処理でマクロを中断させたいって事ですよねこれ？","ts":"1630299905.174400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hqgrt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b1539d5-b4ae-482f-900e-f3b1242610da","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これ、getcharで先行入力吸い上げたら止まらんのかな、知らんけど","ts":"1630299864.173800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9=tw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3eba75d6-b738-42ac-b5c5-4e7d690cff67","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"仕様上ムリって可能性もありますしね…。","ts":"1630299741.173400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2YV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b61cb659-1958-4c32-9e1d-704ddf866b1d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Neovim onlyでもいいからdot repeat API頼む・・・","ts":"1630299736.173200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3g9f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39ff6853-564c-458a-be84-0eb85fd6c0e7","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"特殊っていうかmachakannさんがその辺一番プラグインで作り込んでるレベルだと思うんで、まぁ他の人は基本的に分からないですよね・・・","ts":"1630299598.172400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U8R597E9H","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,