ar}` が見つからないときにマクロをその時点で止めます。これと同じ動作をユーザー定義のモーション、すなわち `:call Motion()\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;` のように定義するモーションで実現したいのですが方法を調べてもわかりませんでした。\n\n`:echoerr` でエラーを発生させると止まりますがもう少し平和的な方法があるとうれしいです。なにかよい方法があればご教授願いたいです。","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"kind/question","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"4","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-jp/issues|vim-jp/issues\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1479185856}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]},{"name":"dajare","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6D9w0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4309f57-1528-43f4-aded-2fae7e1ee16f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ノーマルモードで `\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;` を押すのが一番ラクかなぁ","ts":"1630298884.167900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tbz5h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2dde88e1-537e-4b32-8afa-49ae6defbe6f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"確かに。どうするのがいいんだろう","ts":"1630298462.167500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iCvpT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49f90717-e563-4c60-a350-a56ec39aa427","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"これできるんでしょうか？","ts":"1630298041.167300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UF97"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a85636f1-9a15-455c-8860-3f963411a2b1","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"ユーザー定義モーションでマクロを停止する方法がわからない","ts":"1630297995.166900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=LQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ff77674-c4f6-43fc-abfc-6bd94205b697","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"dot repeatが壊れているからtoggleするmapを入れている","ts":"1630297816.166300","tea